1. The estates of Sławięcice, Birawa, Stara Kuźnia, Lasowice, together with the manufactories and ironworks belonging thereto, as also the estate of Bytków, and the estate of Landsberg possibly still to be purchased, [shall fall] to My eldest daughter Adelheid or her future descendants;

